    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Mild Herbs</strong> <em>(Cooking Rank 1)</em></p><p>Once per meal, you can roll a [[/r 1d4]] and add the number rolled to one saving throw of your choice. You can roll the die before or after making the saving throw.</p><p><em>Artisan Cooking Rank 1 meal boon (DC 10). Apply after eating a successful meal. Duration is typically until your next meal or 24 hours (DM&apos;s call), unless noted otherwise.</em></p>",
